In order to celebrate the Spring Festival, we have added some activities in this version.
  Activity time: 2/6/2021-2/26/2021
  1. During the activity, if you defeat the monster, you will get a "red paper". You can get a lot of gold coins by selling the "red paper" in the market ;
     After the activity, the red paper will stop falling, but the red paper obtained will be retained and can be sold normally ;
  2. During the activity, you can get dumplings by opening the stage treasure chest, and you can get powerful effects after using dumplings ;
     Dumplings Ⅰ : Increases ATK by 30% for 4 hours ;
     Dumplings Ⅱ : Increases SP by 30% for 4 hours ;
     Dumplings Ⅲ : Increases HP by 30% for 4 hours ;
     After the activity, the obtained dumplings will be retained and can be used normally, but the uncollected dumplings in the stage treasure chest will disappear.Please pay attention to receiving rewards in time ;
  Finally , hope you a healthy long life , and everything goes as you wish.

1. Add the "vertical sync" function, you can choose to turn on/off the vertical sync in the setting interface; 2. Fix that the hero experience value becomes negative in some cases; 
3. Fix that the tips may be stuck and does not disappear, in some cases; 
4. Fix the display bug that may appear when the merchant opens the treasure chest;

1. Added "offline treasure chest" function.
Offline time reaches 6 minutes, then enter the game, you can receive offline treasure chest rewards in the town;
The offline treasure chest cannot be opened when the offline time is less than 6 minutes;
Offline treasure chests can accumulate up to 24 hours of rewards;
Upgrading the camp can increase the offline treasure chest level and obtain more output;
2. <Smithy> Refine adjustment.
Adjusted the upper limit of refining attributes from 5 to 4;
Increase the display of the maximum value of refined attributes;
3. Improve the basic sales speed of <market>;
4. Increase the initial level cap of the hero
5. The numerical effect of Resistance + and Resistance- status is adjusted from 25 to 35
6. Reduced the Gem of energy obtained by defeating the Blue Dragon from 10 to 8
7. Increased the health of Snakebite
8. Kaira's "Guardian Defense" learning level was adjusted from "1/4/8/12" to "30/30/30/30"
9. Added game time display in town interface
10. Increase the number of players on the grouping interface and help tips for question marks
11.Fixed Kelly's passive "Following Ahthur" invalid bug
12.Fixed the bug that the initial special effect of Guardian armor is invalid
13.Fixed the bug that the hero shifted position in battle in some cases;
14.Fixed the bug that the damage value disappeared in battle;
15.Fixed the bug that the icon on the backpack interface displayed abnormally in some cases;
16.Fixed the bug that the equipment selection state disappeared when the Smithy was disassembled in some cases;

1.Adjusted the cost of <Camp> technology upgrades；
2.Optimized description of some skills and equipment；
3.Optimized some localized text in traditional version;
4.Fixed the bug that the critical damage increased by the passiveskill "Bestie" was too high;
5.Fixed some text description errors；

1.<Camp> revive functional changes
    We made a big change to the revive function of the camp to make it achieve better       results.
  ·The camp has a new Auto-Revive function,which can be unlocked after the camp is level 2. Click the "Auto-Revive" button to enter the      auto-revive state.When there is an injured character, the character will be dragged         into   position to resurrect it automatically;
  ·After recovering from an injured state, HP regeneration is adjusted to 50%;
  ·Stage recovery was adjusted from "1% injury value every 6 seconds" to "3% injury         value every 6 seconds";
  ·In the camp recovery,recovered 6% damage per second and it will consume some coins         every 6 seconds;
  ·Removed the "Revive" feature;
2.<Tavern> added villager auto-recruit function, which can be unlocked after the tavern is    level 13. When "Auto-Rcruit" is turned on, villagers with stronger effects will be     recruited automatically;
3.Unlock the Limit-break of pets <Ah-meow> and <Snow>;
4.<Smithy> The display of the enchantment interface has been optimized, and the display of   the max value has been increased;
5.Passive skills <HP>, <Attack>, <Spell Power>, <Phisical Defence>, <Magical Defence>,   <Nature Protection> effects have been adjusted from   "Increase Fixed Attribute Value" to   "Increase Percent and Fixed Attribute Value" ;
6.Optimized the game stuck problem;
7.Fixed a bug： caused the game to crash with too many same equipments;
8.Fixed a bug：damage value disappeared in some cases;
9.Fixed a bug：When building a new archive, individual buildings are malfunctioning;
10.Fixed a bug：Cave monsters refresh count is abnormal;
11.Fixed a bug：buff "Shor range shoot", "Crit +" are invalid;
12.Fixed a bug：Pets participating in the event battle are still affected by the number of people;
13.Fixed a bug：In some cases, the prop tips flicker;
14.Fixed a bug: Abnormal playing of background music in some stages;

1.Open a new cave exploration, the cave opens to 800 level;
2.Optimization of some building functions
  The "Auto receive " function has been added to the merchant's automatic purchase page.   When "Auto receive " is turned on, the items obtained through automatic purchase will be automatically collected ;
  Added "Auto receive " function to the Bulletin Board interface. After turning on "Auto receive ", you can automatically receive rewards for completed tasks ;
3.Some treasure adjustments
  <Guardian armor>:Improved treatment effect;
  <Butterfly's spirit>:Improved treatment effect;
  <Angle guards>:Improved treatment effect;
4.Improved the stage exploration speed of chapters 3-6 maps;
5.Slightly reduced the Green dragon's resistance and attack power;
6.Increased the amount of fire produced by the boss's level in the cave;
7.Correct some text errors in some languages;
8.Optimized tips display;
  (The Spring Festival event has ended. Dumplings and red paper will no longer be produced, but the obtained dumplings and red paper can still be used normally.)

Major news
    Excellent DLC for free！
    Our well-prepared DLC is finally released ! This DLC is an artbook, which contains the beautiful drawing of the heroes in the game, and it is completely free!Heroic dragon slayer , cute and lively ninja girl , fearless horsewoman … What will it look like when they get out of the pixel style ? Go to the DLC store interface to download it!

Activity update
    In order to celebrate the Spring Festival, we have added some activities in this version.
    Activity time: 1/16/2020-2/2/2020
    1. During the activity, if you defeat the monster, you will get a "red paper". You can get a lot of gold coins by selling the "red paper" in the market ;
       After the activity, the red paper will stop falling, but the red paper obtained will be retained and can be sold normally ;
    2. During the activity, you can get dumplings by opening the stage treasure chest, and you can get powerful effects after using dumplings ;
       Dumplings Ⅰ : Increases ATK by 30% for 4 hours ;
       Dumplings Ⅱ : Increases SP by 30% for 4 hours ;
       Dumplings Ⅲ : Increases HP by 30% for 4 hours ;
       After the activity, the obtained dumplings will be retained and can be used normally, but the uncollected dumplings in the stage treasure chest will disappear.Please pay attention to receiving rewards in time ;

Regular update
1. Added 6 new equipment attributes : BreakVIT,BreakSTR,BreakINT,BreakDEX,BreakAGI,BreakLUK ;
   Such equipment attributes will not be limited by the cap of hero attributes ;
   Such equipment attributes will appear on some existing equipment, replacing some of the equipment's original attributes ; 
   Such equipment attributes are currently not available through refining ;
2. <Gem of obsidian> optimization, special attributes adjusted to "At the end of the operation, there is a 30% chance to act again.";
3. Fix bug : Skill tips description is abnormal ;
4. Fix some text errors in traditional Chinese version ;

Finally , hope you a healthy long life , and everything goes as you wish.

1.Hero <King> Skill Optimization
"Piercing force" adjusted to real damage ;
The buff applied by "Finger flip with 'chi'" has been adjusted from "Attack +" to a random buff ;
"Super finger flip" effect changed to "For each buff consumed, an additional damage is dealt." ;
"Condensed 'chi' blast" effect was adjusted to "Each buff consumed increases the damage coefficient." ;
2.Reorganized materials and gold coins required for technology upgrades ;
3.Optimized the treasure chest output of some stages ;
4.Fix bug : "Single heal" did not restore HP to the hero with the lowest HP during Auto Battle ;
5.Fix Bug : Kill advanced monsters but drop low-level equipment ;

1. Pet positioning optimization, pets are not counted in the team ;
2. Optimized the effect display of cities and technology in the camp interface ;
3. Improved the recovery effect of the "special effect" bandage and reduced the recovery effect of "Gem of life" ;
4. Reduced Golden Dragon's HP and increased the difficulty of Blue Dragon in Nightmare ;
5. <Catherine> The passive skill "Dual-blade knight" effect was adjusted to "Unable to critically hit, converting half of the critical hit damage into attack percentage",at the same time, increase the damage of the ult skill "blade dance";
6. Fix bug : Skeletal Dragon cannot attack in Nightmare ;
7. Fix bug : Skeletal Dragon's event can be triggered repeatedly ;
8. Fix bug : Hero <Tina> 's skill "Guard of woods" has wrong target quantity in some cases ;
9. Fix bug : The normal attack of the hero <King> will definitely result in "Immobilized" ;
10.Fix bug : Enchant may cause equipment to wear incorrectly ;
11.Fix bug : Display problems of some items in the merchant's Exchange interface ;
12.Fix bug : In some cases, there is no prompt after successful hero Rubuild ;

1. Add a new gameplay: Nightmare.
   After killing the red dragon, you can click the button in the bottom left corner of the endless map to enter the Nightmare;
   In the Nightmare, the stage type will be transformed into a stronghold, there will be new stage special effects, and the monsters will be more difficult and more challenging;
   In the Nightmare, defeat the monsters in the stage, you can permanently occupy the stronghold, and get a lot of gold coins, Limit-break materials, dragon crystal and other rewards;
   In the Nightmare, defeating the dragon will unlock the achievement of killing the dragon in the corresponding nightmare difficulty;
2. Optimize the unlocking conditions in Chapter 4 of the endless mode. Optimize the killing of the Skeletal dragon twice to kill the Skeletal dragon once to unlock the chapter 5 map.
   Some players who have triggered Bone Dragon related events still need to kill Skeletal Dragon twice to unlock the Chapter 5 map;
   Reward issue that triggers events repeatedly: Treasures are unique and cannot be obtained again, but materials rewards can still be obtained;
3. The special attribute of the monster <Black ghost> has been adjusted from "physical immunity" to "magic immunity";
4. Optimization of the special attributes of the treasure <Tumbler>, adjusted from "StunResistance +100" to "RES +100";
5. Fix bug:Some buffs are invalid in some cases;
6. Fix bug:Treasure <Gem of obsidian> special attribute is invalid;
7. Fix bug:Action may cause guardianship to disappear;
8. Fix bug:Certain situations cause the buff to display abnormally during battle;

"1. Increase Japanese language support;
2. Added new level experience books and adjusted the effect of experience books;
3. <Thor>, <Monica> Added passive skills:""Backup guide"",""Backup guide +"";
4. Optimize the display of English text;
5. Fix bug: the skill ""Cleanse"" cannot be used;
6.Fix bug: Some player's Bulletin board missions refresh is abnormal;
7.Fix bug: Some drugs sold at merchant have the wrong price;
8. Fix bug: Do not show buff ""frost"";

1. Added "Attribute Filter" function for equipment, which can be sorted according to the equipment's "grade, life", "attack power" and other attributes
2. Optimized use of props, the maximum number of props used at one time increased to 999;
3. Optimized the level treasure chest of the map in Chapter 2 of the endless mode. Now 6 types of hook jade can be dropped in the second picture;
4. Optimize the later stage exploration and increase the growth rate of later stage exploration;
5. Bug fix: Chapter 3 maps and Chapter 4 maps cannot be occupied in story mode;
6. Bug fix: Monster level over 300 without experience;
7. Bug fix: <Energy Gems> magical properties disappear after breakthrough;
8. Bug fix: the issue of triggering the event < As Tough as Treants>;
In addition, in this update, we set the closing method of the boss key. As long as you paste the following in the "Game.ini" file, the boss key will no longer work.
Copy and paste content:
[/Script/Game.DragonKillerConfig]
OpenBossKey=False
The "Game.ini" file path is as follows:
	C:\Users\{username}\AppData\Local\DragonKiller\Saved\Config\WindowsNoEditor
({Username} is the user name of the computer)

1.English version optimization: information display of achievement store in endless mode;
2.Fix bug: Occupation label display error in English version filtering function;
3.Fix bug: when the damage value to the monster is too high, the damage value becomes 1;
4.Fix bug: in some cases, the experience book is not available;
5.Fix bug: In some cases, skills cannot be learned;
6.Fix bug: After new archive is created, the automatic decomposition function cannot be turned off;

1. Fixed an issue that occasionally gets stuck in battle;
2. Fixed the issue that the English version of achievements shows Chinese;
3. Fix the problem that the English version of villager information is displayed incorrectly;
4. Fixed the issue that the English version of the tavern interface displays Chinese

        After four months of persistent updates, we finally completed the relevant content of the official version of the game as planned and presented it to everyone. Thank you for your support and company. We will continue to update the game in the future. I hope everyone can have fun and continue to support us.
"No-brainer Heroes" 1.0.0 update
1. Add English language support;
2. Endless mode opens the map of the last chapter, the end of Eternal Calamity, and the Black Dragon is waiting for the challenge of the brave on the throne
3. Map of the last chapter in Story Mode Opening: Land of Eternal Calamity;
4. <Altar> Add "Reshape" function, which can consume some materials and re-select the "selectable attributes" when breaking through;
5. The maximum hero level is increased to 300;
6. The maximum level of hero breakthrough is increased to 9;
